          "bbox": [
            0.121,
            0.083,
            0.545,
            0.104
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "？ What about a pyramid with three rows?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.153,
            0.108,
            0.846,
            0.146
          ],
          "content": "Using letter numbers for the bottom row, we can write an expression for the top row."
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "bbox": [
            0.369,
            0.149,
            0.631,
            0.238
          ],
          "content": "<table><tr><td rowspan=2 colspan=2></td><td colspan=2>a + 2b + c</td><td rowspan=2></td></tr><tr><td colspan=2>a + b</td><td>b + c</td></tr><tr><td colspan=2>a</td><td colspan=2>b</td><td>C</td></tr></table>",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_5_table_4.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
