            0.415
          ],
          "content": "2. Write an expression for the topmost row of a pyramid with 4 rows in terms of the values in the bottom row."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.153,
            0.425,
            0.846,
            0.464
          ],
          "content": "3. Without building the entire pyramid, find the number in the topmost row given the bottom row in each of these cases."
        },
        {
